# Prettier formats the `gxy auth` code only: src/auth, test/auth and test/support (and the ESLint
# config, which is ours). Everything else in the package is left as its authors wrote it, so an
# editor that formats on save does not reformat it either. `pnpm format` and eslint.config.js name
# the same scope.
/*
!/src
/src/*
!/src/auth
!/test
/test/*
!/test/auth
!/test/support
!/eslint.config.js
